       All routines except wwiinnnnssttrr may be macros.

       Reading a line that overflows the array pointed to by _s_t_r  with  iinnssttrr,
       mmvviinnssttrr,  mmvvwwiinnssttrr  or wwiinnssttrr causes undefined results.  Therefore, the
       use of iinnnnssttrr, mmvviinnnnssttrr, mmvvwwiinnnnssttrr, or wwiinnnnssttrr is recommended.

