       SVr4 does not document whether a length limit includes or excludes  the
       trailing NUL.

       The _n_c_u_r_s_e_s library extends the X/Open Curses description by allowing a
       negative value for _n.  In this case, the functions  return  the  string
       ending at the right margin.

